# 跨平台换行与二进制声明：仓库内文本一律 LF（Windows 检出按 core.autocrlf）；
# docx/jar/媒体等显式按二进制处理，防止 text=auto 误判造成损坏
* text=auto
gradlew text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf

*.jar binary
*.docx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.onnx binary
*.tar.bz2 binary
*.db binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
